WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.110 --> 00:00:02.470
- I had the honor of visiting
the White House last week

00:00:02.470 --> 00:00:03.420
to interview the First Lady.

00:00:03.420 --> 00:00:05.510
It's still sinking in.

00:00:05.510 --> 00:00:09.970
After our chat, Dr. Biden
asked me just casual-like,

00:00:09.970 --> 00:00:12.080
was like, "Oh, you want to
go see the Oval Office?"

00:00:12.080 --> 00:00:13.610
And I was like, who says no to that?

00:00:13.610 --> 00:00:14.830
No one says no to that.

00:00:14.830 --> 00:00:16.420
And it's kind of overwhelming.

00:00:16.420 --> 00:00:17.350
See, there we are.

00:00:17.350 --> 00:00:18.352
Isn't that so cool?

00:00:18.352 --> 00:00:19.185
(audience laughing)

00:00:19.185 --> 00:00:20.018
So cool.

00:00:20.018 --> 00:00:20.940
It's never not gonna be cool.

00:00:20.940 --> 00:00:23.710
I'm getting it like,
blown-up in my office.

00:00:23.710 --> 00:00:25.950
But it's just nice to be in a place

00:00:25.950 --> 00:00:29.180
where really important things happen.

00:00:29.180 --> 00:00:31.390
And the President was so welcoming.

00:00:31.390 --> 00:00:34.190
And what's crazy is Dr.
Biden told the President

00:00:34.190 --> 00:00:35.850
that my mama was a teacher,

00:00:35.850 --> 00:00:37.890
and he immediately,
like, didn't skip a beat,

00:00:37.890 --> 00:00:39.610
and he goes, "Well, let's just
call her, let's call her."

00:00:39.610 --> 00:00:40.735
And I was like, "What?"

00:00:40.735 --> 00:00:41.568
(audience laughing)

00:00:41.568 --> 00:00:42.850
And then he asked for her number,

00:00:42.850 --> 00:00:44.950
and then I look like
such a horrible daughter

00:00:44.950 --> 00:00:47.360
because no one knows
anyone's number. (laughing)

00:00:47.360 --> 00:00:48.193
(audience laughing)

00:00:48.193 --> 00:00:51.298
You just know mom in your
contacts, so. (laughing)

00:00:51.298 --> 00:00:52.131
(audience laughing)

00:00:52.131 --> 00:00:54.450
So now the aides are running around

00:00:54.450 --> 00:00:57.460
trying to track down my
phone with my assistant,

00:00:57.460 --> 00:00:58.940
and I'm stressing, 'cause I'm like,

00:00:58.940 --> 00:01:01.310
you really don't have
to do it, it's so nice.

00:01:01.310 --> 00:01:04.090
And I'm literally standing
in the Oval Office,

00:01:04.090 --> 00:01:07.870
the Oval Office, mm-hmm,
just having a conversation

00:01:07.870 --> 00:01:09.790
with President Biden and Dr. Jill Biden

00:01:09.790 --> 00:01:11.990
while they're trying
to get ahold of my mom.

00:01:11.990 --> 00:01:15.270
And then I look up, and
Tricia shows up with my phone,

00:01:15.270 --> 00:01:17.510
and my musical director is with her.

00:01:17.510 --> 00:01:18.970
And, were y'all-

00:01:18.970 --> 00:01:20.660
Y'all looked like you were freaking out.

00:01:20.660 --> 00:01:22.850
- Well, to be honest, I was just starving,

00:01:22.850 --> 00:01:24.580
and I asked Tricia if
there was a sandwich,

00:01:24.580 --> 00:01:26.240
and she said they had 'em
in your dressing room.

00:01:26.240 --> 00:01:27.760
So when they came to get Tricia,

00:01:27.760 --> 00:01:29.380
I grabbed your big makeup bag real quick

00:01:29.380 --> 00:01:30.409
thinking, I'm getting a sandwich.

00:01:30.409 --> 00:01:31.242
(Kelly laughing)

00:01:31.242 --> 00:01:32.075
(audience laughing)

00:01:32.075 --> 00:01:33.267
I never got the sandwich, but
I got to meet the President,

00:01:33.267 --> 00:01:35.625
and I will carry your makeup bag any day.

00:01:35.625 --> 00:01:36.458
(audience applauding)

00:01:36.458 --> 00:01:37.420
- That was amazing.

00:01:37.420 --> 00:01:40.290
I walk up and Jason's holding
a makeup bag, and I was like-

00:01:40.290 --> 00:01:43.210
And it's like, the President's
there, and we're leaving.

00:01:43.210 --> 00:01:46.020
And I said, "Oh, President
Biden, this is Tricia."

00:01:46.020 --> 00:01:47.200
And then all of a sudden I see Jason.

00:01:47.200 --> 00:01:49.288
I was like, why is Jason
holding a makeup bag?

00:01:49.288 --> 00:01:50.121
(Jason laughing)

00:01:50.121 --> 00:01:51.390
(audience laughing)
I was like, what's happening?

00:01:51.390 --> 00:01:52.650
And he just wanted a sandwich.

00:01:52.650 --> 00:01:53.483
We didn't get that.

00:01:53.483 --> 00:01:57.610
But the President called
my mom the next day.

00:01:57.610 --> 00:01:58.560
Literally.

00:01:58.560 --> 00:02:00.390
And my mom answered the phone.

00:02:00.390 --> 00:02:01.300
She was like, "Hello?"

00:02:01.300 --> 00:02:03.730
And he was like, "Hi, I'm Joe Biden."

00:02:03.730 --> 00:02:06.584
(laughing) And I was
like, what did you say?

00:02:06.584 --> 00:02:07.417
(audience laughing)

00:02:07.417 --> 00:02:09.150
Anyway, so we have her dialed in,

00:02:09.150 --> 00:02:13.144
my mom is actually dialed in
right now, so what's up, Mom?

00:02:13.144 --> 00:02:14.316
(audience applauding)
- Sweetheart.

00:02:14.316 --> 00:02:15.353
- [Kelly] Hi.

